<title>GREECE: GREEK OFFICIAL TAX EVATION LIST.</title>
<headline>GREEK OFFICIAL TAX EVATION LIST.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Economy Minister, Yannos Papantoniou, has submitted an official list of firms and individuals who have either been accused or convicted of evading taxes, Flash radio said.</p>
<p>The list contains 481 names of companies and self-employed persons who are involved in 181 cases of forged invoices and 16 cases of customs violations.</p>
<p>Of these 182 cases have already gone to trial, Flash added. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
